flowchart LR
    subgraph Clients
        WEB[Web App SPA]
        API_C[Public API clients]
    end
    GW[API Gateway / BFF<br/>auth, rate limit, workspace routing]
    WEB --> GW
    API_C --> GW

    subgraph Core["Core (modular monolith -> microservices)"]
        ID[Identity & Tenancy]
        CT[Content Service]
        PB[Publishing Orchestrator]
        BL[Billing Service]
    end
    GW --> ID & CT & PB & BL

    BUS[(Event Bus / Queue<br/>Redis Streams MVP)]
    PB <--> BUS
    CT <--> BUS
    BL <--> BUS

    subgraph Workers
        PW[Publish Worker]
        MW[Media Worker]
        AW[AI Adaptation Worker]
        SCH[Scheduler]
    end
    BUS --> PW & MW & AW & SCH
    SCH -->|job due| BUS

    subgraph IntLayer["Channel Integration Layer"]
        REG[Adapter Registry]
        TG{{Telegram}}
        VK{{VK}}
        YT{{YouTube}}
        BLOG{{Blog/WP}}
        VAULT[Token Vault]
    end
    PW --> REG
    REG --> TG & VK & YT & BLOG
    PW --> VAULT
    TG & VK & YT & BLOG --> SOC[(Social Network APIs)]

    PG[(PostgreSQL + RLS)]
    S3[(S3/MinIO media)]
    RD[(Redis cache/counters)]
    ID & CT & PB & BL --> PG
    CT & MW --> S3
    PB & BL --> RD
    AW --> LLM[LLM Providers]
